{"candidate_identity":"79fba46dc85a4f2e30f2a6ce94aea537c77ef4441d487af2211e2760ab856612","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"54bb9edc1926ccd3391d24db870b41d6634efb1fbd02ccfe7542efa9ce0eb31d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"adb7df7bdb3876ef00d028de29c559b08757fb7d607b25095c63f8ea4dfdfba1","logical_entry_identity":"b823ce70dc61b6b542f785b4d6381536532de74ceb8465f2f5c60dd6ff5cb837","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This is fairly close to saying that you knock a turn off the duration of timed effects for every five points that your defensive #GOLD#combat stat#WHITE# score beats the attacker's offensive #GOLD#combat stat#WHITE#.\n\nThere are some subtle differences, however.\n\nAs you may have noticed earlier, your #LIGHT_GREEN#Spellpower#WHITE# of 56 against an orc's #LIGHT_GREEN#Physical save#WHITE# of 70, despite having a difference of only 14, resulted in a three-turn duration decrease. This is because the orc's score of 70 gives it 14 turns of duration reduction, but your score of 56 only undoes 11 of those turns, resulting in a reduction of 3 turns.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"这大致相当于：你的防御性 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 数值每超出攻击者的攻击性 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 5 点，就能使持续效果的持续时间缩短 1 回合。\n\n不过，两者之间存在一些细微差别。\n\n正如你先前可能注意到的，你的 56 点 #LIGHT_GREEN#法术强度#WHITE# 对抗兽人的 70 点 #LIGHT_GREEN#物理豁免#WHITE#，尽管差值只有 14 点，却导致持续时间缩短了 3 回合。这是因为兽人的 70 点数值让它获得了 14 回合的减免，而你的 56 点数值只抵消了其中的 11 回合，最终导致缩短了 3 回合。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e55fa116b7e787908c6752d73f7a8c32c3619346b3bd529133a862adffb8d0cf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"adbab6f254facc1c860deea51384e1d3fc6e8425389d1e575b43cc8b1a53a7c0","logical_entry_identity":"89d85bc5da224e4f960f286c65f51be1bb25ff392d170202ef20701eef93c3e0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED#You have %d life(s) left.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_RED#你还剩下%d条生命。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7f581f243f858c735d472905fa6c3908518c04d7468d7c