ments of anything caught inside\n- #YELLOW#Shatter: #WHITE#Shatter all frozen creatures in your sight, dealing increased damage or even killing them\n- #YELLOW#Uttercold: #WHITE#Master the Uttercold and pierce even through cold immunities\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"自始以来法师们进行着各种元素试验。\n大多数法师满足于使用水系魔法，有些人则进行深入的研究并创造出了冰系魔法。\n其核心是“绝对零度”，一种极寒，甚至能伤害通常免疫寒冷的生物。\n\n你掌握了冰系魔法，现在你可以创建新的元素法师和死灵法师角色，让他们学习 #LIGHT_GREEN#冰系技能#WHITE#。\n\n技能：\n- #YELLOW# 冻结：#WHITE# 凝聚目标周围的水，对其造成伤害并使其冻结。\n- #YELLOW# 冻结大地：#WHITE# 在地上施放一个冰冻新星，使其中的生物无法移动。\n- #YELLOW# 寒冰破碎：#WHITE# 对你视线内的所有冰冻目标造成更高伤害，甚至直接将其杀死。\n- #YELLOW# 绝对零度：#WHITE# 掌握绝对零度，甚至能穿透寒冷免疫。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bba8169068280728ab2e062f3d9e3885494983b9303257100805f5b9729ee2d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ade16ec400b19c24f863c093f2a6581ffee3e553f20d66c4adad4bf5bb8b64e2","logical_entry_identity":"6044c69b804a0144e0620a1b94769f483e91ba11b7551c802024cf3a215beb0e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is surrounded by a space distortion that randomly sends (%d%% chance) incoming damage to another target (%s). Absorbs %d/%d damage before it crumbles.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被一层扭曲空间包围，有 %d%% 几率将受到的伤害偏转给另一个目标（%s）。护盾在破裂前还能吸收 %d/%d 点伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"55828dc92938a2428deb9dc02755c600819a01d2f16ce298ef714155c371f979","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ade54bee118a2a0c09220dd0a64a5b2279f084137b673660d03285288d9e3787","logical_entry_identity":"14a0c68b029425401ea4c6460c14f247b29d71b2cfc60ac47a82a9849e363e73","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Max wilder summons: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"最大自然召唤数："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"19fea1aef6e95c3f4b80788060b833d08798decd42be2e45f5c128da6272a56e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"adea559195f1afb0f276534d3429a529ce7b51eafac4f728de2a0399c6bc033d","logical_entry_identity":"c8d47123b600f852be2eddd2859e21ecd0baadd5f1302a9bcd4da78ee92e4945","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Silk Curr